# ====================
# 3. CMake 生成的各种中间文件和缓存
# ====================
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
CPackConfig.cmake
CPackSourceConfig.cmake
CTestTestfile.cmake
*-prefix/
*-build/
*-install/
Makefile
*.o
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.lib
*.a
*.exe
*.out

# ====================
# 4. 编译产生的测试/示例可执行文件
# ====================
